# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit .env (already in .gitignore).
# Web3Forms access key for the contact form — get one at https://web3forms.com
# Note: VITE_ vars are embedded in the public JS bundle. Web3Forms access
# keys are designed to be public, but enable spam protection in the
# Web3Forms dashboard (the form also has a honeypot field).
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
